r\\nPokémon, have a word with my wife.","msg_0439_00001":"Ah, it’s you!\\rWe were raising your Pokémon,\\nand my goodness, were we surprised!\\rYour Pokémon was holding an Egg!\\rWe don’t know how it got there,\\nbut your Pokémon had it.\\rYou do want it, don’t you? {YESNO 0}","msg_0439_00002":"Ah, it’s you! Good to see you.\\nYour {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}’s doing just fine.","msg_0439_00003":"Well then, I’ll hang on to it.\\nThanks!","msg_0439_00004":"You have no room for it right now...\\nCome back when you’ve made room.","msg_0439_00005":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received the Egg from\\nthe Day-Care Man.","msg_0439_00006":"You take good care of it.","msg_0439_00007":"","msg_0439_00008":"","msg_0439_00009":"Ah, it’s you!\\nGood to see you!\\rYour {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} and {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\\nare doing just fine.\\r","msg_0439_00010":"I really will keep it.\\nYou do want this Egg, yes? {YESNO 0}","msg_0439_00011":"Take good care of it!\\rThat is, I don’t think we’ll ever find\\nanother...\\rNo, no, I’m sure we’ll find another one.\\nI’m definitely sure of it!\\r","msg_0439_00012":"Well all right then, I’ll take it.\\nThank you.\\rThat is, I don’t think we’ll ever find\\nanother...\\rNo, no, I’m sure we’ll find another one.\\nI’m definitely sure of it!\\r","msg_0439_00013":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\\nIf we are looking after your Pokémon\\fand notice one is holding an Egg, would\\fyou like me to contact you by\\fphone? Would that be all right? {YESNO 0}","msg_0439_00014":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\\nIf we are looking after your Pokémon\\fand notice one is holding an Egg, would\\fyou like me to contact you by\\fphone? Would that be all right? {YESNO 0}","msg_0439_00015":"You can leave it up to us!\\rAny Pokémon you’d like to have raised\\nyou can leave in my wife’s care.","msg_0439_00016":"I see. Well, that’s fine.\\rAny Pokémon you’d like to have raised\\nyou can leave in my wife’s care.","msg_0439_00017":"The two seem to get along very well.","msg_0439_00018":"The two seem to get along.","msg_0439_00019":"The two don’t seem to like each\\nother much.","msg_0439_00020":"The two play with other\\nPokémon rather than with each other...","msg_0439_00021":"I’m the Day-Care Lady.\\nWe can raise Pokémon for you.\\rWould you like us to raise your\\nPokémon? {YESNO 0}","msg_0439_00022":"Which Pokémon should we raise for\\nyou?\\r","msg_0439_00023":"Fine, we’ll raise your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\\nfor a while.\\rCome back for it later.\\r","msg_0439_00024":"We can raise two of your Pokémon.\\nWould you like us to raise another? {YESNO 0}","msg_0439_00025":"Ah, there you are!\\nMy husband was looking for you.","msg_0439_00026":"Oh, fine, then.\\nCome again.","msg_0439_00027":"You don’t have enough money...","msg_0439_00028":"Do you want to take back the other\\none, too? {YESNO 0}","msg_0439_00029":"Very good.\\nCome again.","msg_0439_00030":"Ah, it’s you! Good to see you.\\nNow, about your Pokémon...\\r","msg_0439_00031":"By level, your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} has\\ngrown by about {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0}.\\r","msg_0439_00032":"Your Pokémon team is full.\\nMake room, then come see me.","msg_0439_00033":"If you want your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} back,\\nit will cost ${STRVAR_1 53, 1, 0}. {YESNO 0}","msg_0439_00034":"Excellent!\\nHere’s your Pokémon.\\r","msg_0439_00035":"{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} took {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} back\\nfrom the Day-Care Lady.\\r","msg_0439_00036":"Oh? But you only have one\\nPokémon with you.\\rYou can’t go off without a Pokémon.\\nCome back another time.","msg_0439_00037":"Do you want your Pokémon back? {YESNO 0}","msg_0439_00038":"If you leave me that Pokémon,\\nwhat are you gonna battle with?\\rCome back another time.","msg_0439_00039":"Huh? Now, now.\\rIf you leave that Pokémon with\\nme, you’ll be left with just one.\\rYou will be better off if you catch\\nsome more, if I do say so myself.","msg_0439_00040":"Now, now.\\nThat is merely an Egg!","msg_0439_00041":"Fine, we’ll raise your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\\nfor a while.\\rCome back for it later.","msg_0439_00042":"","msg_0439_00043":"","msg_0439_00044":"","msg_0439_00045":"","msg_0439_00046":"","msg_0439_00047":"The two seem to get along very well.\\r","msg_0439_00048":"The two seem to get along.\\r","msg_0439_00049":"The two don’t seem to like each\\nother much.\\r","msg_0439_00050":"The two play with other\\nPokémon rather than with each other...\\r"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_0265_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_0265_001":1}}
